  description: "Each time 2 or more \"Yummy\" monsters are Special Summoned to your
    field at the same time, you gain 500 LP, and if you do, your opponent loses 500
    LP. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Yum\u2606Yum\u2606Yummys\"
    once per turn. You can pay 500 LP, then target 2 face-up monsters on the field
    including a \"Yummy\u2605Snatchy\"; send both to the GY, and if you do, Special
    Summon 1 \"Yummy\" Synchro Monster from your Extra Deck (this is treated as a
    Synchro Summon). If your opponent activates a card or effect (except during the
    Damage Step): You can pay 100 LP; immediately after this effect resolves, Link
    Summon 1 \"Yummy\" Link Monster."
